},
{
  "id": "c130",
  "name": "Exhibit C §1. Lease dates",
  "text": "1. The Commencement Date of the Lease is , 2004. The Delivery Date under the Lease is , 2004. The Rent Commencement Date of the Lease is , 2004."
},
{
  "id": "c131",
  "name": "Exhibit C §2. Expiration Date",
  "text": "2. The Expiration Date of the Lease is , 2019, subject to Section 3.3 of the Lease."
},
{
  "id": "c132",
  "name": "Exhibit C §3. Renewal options",
  "text": "3. Tenant has three (3) options of five (5) years each which are automatically exercised unless Tenant presents notice to Landlord by no later than (a) ,_ with respect to ihe first option; (b) _ with respect to the second option; and {c) with respect to the third option. The expiration of such options is in each case subject to Section 3.3 of the Lease."
},
{
  "id": "c133",
  "name": "Declaration Recital A — Restricted Property",
  "text": "A. Landlord owns the parcels of real estate in . County, New York legally described on Exhibit A attached hereto (“Restricted Property\")."
},
{
  "id": "c134",
  "name": "Declaration Recital B — Gander Mountain Lease",
  "text": "B. in consideration of that certain Lease dated as of April 16, 2004, by Pathmark Stores, inc., as Landlord and Gander Mountain Company, as Tenant (\"Gander Mountain Lease”), leasing certain premises located in Johnson City, Broome County, New York (“Premises”), Restricted Party, an affiliate of Landiord, has agreed to subject the Restricted Property to certain restrictions."
