  },
  {
    "id": "c161",
    "name": "Memorandum §1. Premises",
    "text": "1, Premises. For and in consideration of the rents and of the covenants and agreements contained in that certain Lease by Landlord and Tenant dated as of April 16, 2004 (\"Lease\"), Landlord has leased to Tenant and Tenant has leased from Landlord those certain premises described in the Lease (\"Premises\") located in Johnson City, Broome County, New York on the portion of the property legally described on Exhibit A attached hereto and made a part hereof."
  },
  {
    "id": "c162",
    "name": "Memorandum §2. Term",
    "text": "2. Term. The initial term of the Lease is for a period commencing on the Commencement Date (as defined in the Lease) and expiring on the fifleenth (15\") anniversary date of the Commencement Date, unless the Lease shail sooner end and terminate as provided in the Lease. Subject to the terms and provisions of the Lease, Tenant is given three {3} exlension options of five (5) years each in the Lease."
  },
  {
    "id": "c163",
    "name": "Memorandum §3. Use",
    "text": "3. Use. The Premises may be used for any lawful purpose, subject to certain specific prohibited uses set out in the Lease."
  },
  {
    "id": "c164",
    "name": "Memorandum §4. Memorandum of Lease",
    "text": "4, Memorandum of Lease. This Memorandum of Lease is executed in accordance with the terms of this Lease for the purpose of giving notice of the existence thereof. The Lease is deemed to bea material part hereof as though set forth at fength herein. Whenever a conflict of provisions between this Memorandum of Lease and the Lease shall occur, the provisions of the Lease shail govern."
  },
  {
